        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86188, 72 Inch Square Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 72 Inch Stainless Steel Square Door Pull has 60 inch centers. It is available in thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, and back to back mounting. This stainless steel door pull is available in  modern finish colors. The square grip will grant any door a modern feel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86188-Specifications.jpg?v=1704354640\" width=\"597\" height=\"124\" boarder=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 86188 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in Other Lengths \r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-square-door-pull-emtek-86191\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-36-inch-square-door-pull-emtek-86192\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a>, or\r\n<a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-48-inch-square-door-pull-emtek-86187\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 86188 Contemporary Square 72 Inch Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 72\" </li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\" (with rosette)</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door. Packaged with  Decorative Screw Cover Caps.</li>\r\n<li><b>Concealed Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Comes as a set of 2 pulls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Long-Pulls-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354641\" width=\"585\" height=\"179\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Long Pull Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
